## How it was tested

- [ ] Unit tests
- [ ] Integration tests (`make test` starts the whole service with a PostgreSQL container)
- [ ] Manual test

## Checklist

- [ ] `make generate` was run after changing `proto/`, `migrations/` or SQL queries
- [ ] API changes are backward compatible (`make breaking`), or the break is intended and announced
- [ ] New migrations are backward compatible with the running version (expand, then contract)
- [ ] New queries are covered by an index (no sequential scan on large tables)
- [ ] Errors returned to clients are `errs` errors; no internal details leak
